# Text files are stored with LF, and checked out with LF on every machine, Windows too. CI, the server and the
# Docker images all read LF. A CRLF checkout (core.autocrlf) breaks a shell script copied into an image, and the
# tests that read source files.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.webp binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
